Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:15.16,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\an9\bord4\3c&H422D63&\c&HAA9986&\fs52}中獎了就能再來一根!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.73,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHanziPenW3-A\fs76\b1\c&HF7F6F9&\fry20\frz-10\fax0.2\move(715,200,779,200,0,2982)}暑假
